ி","parts":[{"text":"அணி","lemma":"அணி","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"நிறம்","parts":[{"text":"நிறம்","lemma":"நிறம்","gloss":"color"}],"gloss":"color"},{"surface":"கொழு","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"கொழு","gloss":"plump"}],"gloss":"plump"},{"surface":"முகை","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"bud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வண்டு","parts":[{"text":"வண்டு","lemma":"வண்டு","gloss":"bee"}],"gloss":"bee"},{"surface":"வாய்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth"}],"gloss":"mouth"},{"surface":"திறக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"திறக்கும்","lemma":"திற","gloss":"will open"}],"gloss":"will open"},{"surface":"தண்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"}],"gloss":"cool"},{"surface":"துறை","parts":[{"text":"துறை","lemma":"துறை","gloss":"shore"}],"gloss":"shore"},{"surface":"ஊரனொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஊரன்","lemma":"ஊரன்","gloss":"man of the town"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the man of the town"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இருப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"be/sit"},{"text":"பின்","lemma":"பின்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if we sit"},{"surface":"இரு","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"two"}],"gloss":"two"},{"surface":"மருங்கினமே","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கினமே","lemma":"மருங்கினமே","gloss":"on the sides indeed"}],"gloss":"on the sides indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கிடப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"கிட","lemma":"கிட","gloss":"lie down"},{"text":"பின்","lemma":"பின்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if we lie down"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வில்","parts":[{"text":"வில்","lemma":"வில்","gloss":"bow"}],"gloss":"bow"},{"surface":"அகம்","parts":[{"text":"அகம்","lemma":"அகம்","gloss":"inside"}],"gloss":"inside"},{"surface":"விரலில்","parts":[{"text":"விரல்","lemma":"விரல்","gloss":"finger"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"in"}],"gloss":"in the finger"},{"surface":"பொருந்தி","parts":[{"text":"பொருந்து","lemma":"பொருந்து","gloss":"fit"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having fitted"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"அகம்","parts":[{"text":"அகம்","lemma":"அகம்","gloss":"chest"}],"gloss":"chest"},{"surface":"சேரின்","parts":[{"text":"சேர்","lemma":"சேர்","gloss":"reach/embrace"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if we embrace"},{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"மருங்கினமே","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கினமே","lemma":"மருங்கினமே","gloss":"on one side indeed"}],"gloss":"on one side indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Pond's water lily's beautiful-colored plump bud / the bee opens its mouth [at], of the cool-shore town's chief with, / if [we] sit, on both sides [we] are; if [we] lie down, / like [the string] fitted to the finger inside the bow, he / if [we] embrace [his] good chest, on one side [we] are.","translation":"With the chief of the cool-shored town, where bees open the plump, beautifully colored buds of the pond's water lilies: if we sit, we are on two separate sides; but if we lie down and embrace his beautiful chest, we are on one side, like the bow-string fitted to the finger inside the bow.","modern":"குளத்து ஆம்பலின் அழகிய நிறமுடைய பருத்த மொட்டுகளை வண்டுகள் வாய் திறந்து தேன் உண்ணும் குளிர்ந்த துறையை உடைய ஊரனோடு, நாம் அமர்ந்திருந்தால் இரு பக்கங்களிலும் தனித்தனியாக இருக்கிறோம்; ஆனால் படுத்துக்கொண்டு அவனுடைய நல்ல மார்பைத் தழுவினால், வில்லின் உள்ளே விரலோடு பொருந்திய நாணினைப் போல, நாம் ஒரே பக்கமாக ஒன்றிவிடுகிறோம்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the courtesan (parattai) about her intimate union with the hero. The setting belongs to the Marutam (agricultural) landscape, where ponds, water lilies, and bees represent fertility and sensory pleasures. The courtesan describes how, when she and the hero merely sit together, they remain separate individuals on two sides. However, when they lie down and embrace, they merge into a single entity. She compares this physical and emotional union to an archer's finger fitted perfectly to the bow-string inside the bow, where the string and the finger align as one. The key words are 'இரு மருங்கினமே' (on two sides) and 'ஒரு மருங்கினமே' (on one side).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.65,0.8],[0.8,1.8],[1.8,2.2],[2.2,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,4.26],[4.3,5.38],[5.38,6.25],[6.25,6.5],[6.5,7.1],[7.1,7.6],[7.6,7.93],[7.93,8.5],[8.5,9.6],[9.6,9.9],[10.13,10.36],[10.47,10.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.75,0.9],[0.9,1.9],[1.9,2.3],[2.3,3.7],[3.7,4.0],[4.0,4.7],[4.72,5.33],[5.33,5.95],[5.95,6.85],[6.85,7.1],[7.1,7.8],[7.8,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.8],[9.8,10.66],[10.66,11.0],[11.14,11.87],[11.87,12.4]]},"sync":[[["பொய்கை","pond"]],[["ஆம்பல்","water lily"]],[["ஆம்பல்","water lily"],["அணி","beautiful"],["நிறம்","color"]],[["கொழு","plump"],["முகை","bud"]],[["வண்டு","bee"],["வாய்","mouth"]],[["திறக்கும்","will open"]],[["தண்","cool"],["துறை","shore"]],[["ஊரனொடு","with the man of the town"]],[["இருப்பின்","if we sit"]],[["இருப்பின்","if we sit"],["இரு","two"],["மருங்கினமே","on the sides indeed"]],[["மருங்கினமே","on the sides indeed"]],[["கிடப்பின்","if we lie down"]],[["வில்","bow"],["அகம்","inside"]],[["விரலில்","in the finger"]],[["பொருந்தி","having fitted"],["அவன்","he"]],[["நல்","good"],["அகம்","chest"]],[["சேரின்","if we embrace"]],[["சேரின்","if we embrace"],["ஒரு","one"],["மருங்கினமே","on one side indeed"]],[["மருங்கினமே","on one side indeed"]]]}